# RFM Customer Segmentation & Offer Optimization | Power BI

## Project Overview

A Power BI customer intelligence dashboard developed as part of a case
competition to segment customers using RFM analysis and recommend
personalized offers based on customer value and behaviour.

## Methodology

- Performed RFM (Recency, Frequency, Monetary) analysis
- Assigned weights to RFM components to create a composite score
- Segmented 550 customers into five actionable groups
- Mapped customer segments to personalized offers
- Used segment-level insights to support marketing budget allocation

## Key Analysis

- Customer distribution by RFM segment
- Revenue contribution by customer segment
- Revenue by product category
- Monthly order trends
- Segment-specific offer recommendations

